OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,FThe parents of a nine-year-old girl
OL,7,Ffrom Fleet have described their shock
OL,8,Fafter their daughter was left
OL,9,Fseriously injured from being knocked
OL,10,Fdown by an e-scooter.
OL,12,FOttilie Freeman suffered a fractured
OL,13,Fskull and concussion when she was hit
OL,14,Fin Calthorpe Park on 20 June.
OL,16,FHampshire Police is investigating -
OL,17,Fand no arrests have been made.
OL,19,FHer dad Martin Freeman said they had
OL,20,Fgone to the park for an ice-cream when
OL,21,Fthe incident happened.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
