PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,F"Otts was sort of walking along the
OL,7,Fgrassy verge by the tennis courts,
OL,8,Ftapping the wooden bars, and I was
OL,9,Fsort of walking in this service road,
OL,10,Fno traffic," he said.
OL,12,F"Of course I feel terrible, I stepped
OL,13,Fforward, she steps into the road, and
OL,14,Fyeah before I knew it I heard this
OL,15,Fzipping noise and I sort of then
OL,16,Fturned fully and there was this young
OL,17,Flad on his escooter.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,F"I shouted, you know, 'Otts!', she
OL,7,Fsort of ran in response to my shout
OL,8,Fand of course she changed direction ,
OL,9,Fhe moved with her and the next thing I
OL,10,Fknow he'd knocked her flying."
OL,12,FOttilie was taken to hospital for
OL,13,Fchecks and was later discharged, but
OL,14,Fafter started vomiting doctors
OL,15,Frevealed she had bleeding on the brain.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,F"They brought in all the experts, and
OL,7,FI put Amy in her state, if I can say
OL,8,Fthat - so they think she's got
OL,9,Fbleeding on her brain, internal
OL,10,Fbleeding. And, you know, it's hard to
OL,11,Fprocess that.
OL,13,F"You hear there are kids that haven't
OL,14,Fwalked out of hospital from these
OL,15,Fthings, and to have that realisation
OL,16,Fthat this could be our little girl
OL,17,Flike that was frightening."
OL,19,FOttilie sustained a fractured skull
OL,20,Fand is now back home recovering.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,F"There's a lot of things she can't do.
OL,8,F"She can't go on a trampoline or play
OL,9,Fsport or anything like that for 12
OL,10,Fweeks.
OL,12,F"Whenever she goes to the park, she
OL,13,Fhas to wear a helmet.
OL,15,F"She can't ride her scooter."
OL,17,FOttilie's parents believe they should
OL,18,Feither be legalised with enforcement
OL,19,Fin place, or banned altogether.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,F"I think they should either be
OL,7,Flegalised so people are held
OL,8,Faccountable where they've got number
OL,9,Fplates and they're registered and they
OL,10,Fneed some sort of driving test or
OL,11,Fsomething to be able to ride them.
OL,13,F"Or to just completely ban them. But
OL,14,Fjust as they are, I think it's really
OL,15,Fdangerous."
OL,17,FPolice are trying to trace the rider
OL,18,Fof the e-scooter.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
