PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785775682
OL,3,CParents' warning after daughter, 9,
OL,4,Cknocked down by e-scooter
OL,6,FA Hampshire Police spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"We want to thank everyone who has
OL,8,Falready come forward and spoken to us
OL,9,Ffollowing our previous appeal.
OL,11,F"He is described as a white male, aged
OL,12,Fbetween 14 and 16 years old, about 5ft
OL,13,F5in tall, slim athletic build, brown
OL,14,Fhair, wearing a white t-shirt and grey
OL,15,Fjoggers."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
